clones/
docs/research/crawl/
docs/research/audit/

# ClickUp API token (local only, never commit)
.clickup.env

# Raw ClickUp workspace data dumps (personal data, regenerable via export:clickup); keep BACKEND_CONTRACT.* at root
docs/research/clickup-export/*/
